  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "rfc7468: don't use for (;;) for tvb_find_line_end() loops.",
  "description": "If you're past the end of the tvbuff, tvb_find_line_end() will, when\nreassembly is not being done, return a zero-length line without\nadvancing next_offset, so, unless you check for being past the end of\nthe tvbuff, you'll loop forever.\n\nFixes #17801.",
